{"seq":3,"slug":"feed-transform-failure-modes","title":"转换异常、分片上传与幂等重试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/feed-build-transform/feed-transform-failure-modes","wordCount":2818,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"转换异常-分片上传与幂等重试\">转换异常、分片上传与幂等重试</h1><p>一批 80 万 SKU 的 feed 在生成到 61% 时进程 OOM 被杀，重启后从头再跑；一个 180MB 的 gzip 包传到 92% 连接被掐断，重传又排在队尾等了四十分钟；渠道后台商品数比 PIM 多出两万多个，去重后发现是上一次超时的重试其实已经成功，系统「不知道它成功了」又推了一遍。这三类故障分别发生在<strong>转换期</strong>、<strong>传输期</strong>和<strong>平台侧写入期</strong>，症状不同，但要求同一件事：任何一步失败都要能精确定位到 item、能从断点继续、且重复执行不产生副作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一条-feed-流水线的三个失败面\">核心概念：一条 feed 流水线的三个失败面</h2><p>feed 从内部主数据到渠道可见跨越三个物理边界，每个有各自的失败模式与恢复语义。混为一谈是运维混乱的根因——「重跑一遍」对转换期安全，对写入期可能是灾难。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[内部主数据&lt;br/&gt;PIM snapshot] --&gt; B[映射与序列化&lt;br/&gt;transform]&#10;  B --&gt;|失败面 1&lt;br/&gt;单 item 异常 / 进程崩溃| C[待上传制品&lt;br/&gt;gzip blob]&#10;  C --&gt;|失败面 2&lt;br/&gt;连接中断 / 超时| D[渠道接入层&lt;br/&gt;presigned URL / 分片]&#10;  D --&gt;|失败面 3&lt;br/&gt;重复写入 / 部分应用| E[渠道商品库&lt;br/&gt;platform store]&#10;  E --&gt; F[回执与状态&lt;br/&gt;feed status / error report]&#10;  F --&gt;|不一致| G[对账补偿&lt;br/&gt;reconcile]&#10;  G --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[内部主数据&lt;br/&gt;PIM snapshot] --&gt; B[映射与序列化&lt;br/&gt;transform]\n  B --&gt;|失败面 1&lt;br/&gt;单 item 异常 / 进程崩溃| C[待上传制品&lt;br/&gt;gzip blob]\n  C --&gt;|失败面 2&lt;br/&gt;连接中断 / 超时| D[渠道接入层&lt;br/&gt;presigned URL / 分片]\n  D --&gt;|失败面 3&lt;br/&gt;重复写入 / 部分应用| E[渠道商品库&lt;br/&gt;platform store]\n  E --&gt; F[回执与状态&lt;br/&gt;feed status / error report]\n  F --&gt;|不一致| G[对账补偿&lt;br/&gt;reconcile]\n  G --&gt; B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败面</th>\n<th>典型症状</th>\n<th>可否盲目重跑</th>\n<th>正确恢复语义</th>\n<th>必须的观测手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转换期</td>\n<td>单 item 字段异常、进程 OOM、磁盘写满</td>\n<td>可以（幂等生成）</td>\n<td>从 checkpoint 续跑，跳过已完成区间</td>\n<td>逐 item 错误记录 + 进度游标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输期</td>\n<td>连接 reset、网关超时、URL 过期</td>\n<td>可以（分片重传成本低）</td>\n<td>按分片续传或整包重传，先校验哈希</td>\n<td>分片清单 + 制品 checksum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台侧写入</td>\n<td>回执超时但实际已生效、部分 item 应用</td>\n<td><strong>不可以</strong></td>\n<td>先查询再决定补发，用唯一键去重</td>\n<td>渠道 feed/批次状态 + 唯一键索引</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断标准很朴素：<strong>重跑会不会产生两个可观测的结果？</strong> 转换期和传输期不会（同一制品覆盖同一制品），写入期会（同一条商品被创建两次）。这条判断决定后面所有设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转换期异常-把批量失败降解为逐-item-失败\">转换期异常：把批量失败降解为逐 item 失败</h2><p>最昂贵的转换异常不是「某个字段算错了」，而是「一个坏 item 让整批失败」。若序列化器写成「遍历所有 item，遇异常即抛」，那么 80 万条里有一条标题含非法控制字符，整批就报废，运维只看到一个堆栈。正确形态是<strong>逐 item 隔离</strong>：每条 item 的转换包在独立错误边界内，产出要么是制品片段，要么是结构化错误记录。</p>\n<p>失败半径决定策略：设批次总数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、失败集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = |E| / N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; 0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span>）时把失败 item 投入死信队列、其余照常发布是对的——为 300 条坏数据卡住 80 万条更新不划算。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 很大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &gt; 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>）时反过来：这通常意味着映射规则出了系统性问题（某个必填字段的源路径整体为空、某个枚举翻译表整批失效），<strong>必须整批中止</strong>，因为发出去的每一批都在污染渠道商品库。</p>\n<p>错误记录的最小字段集：<code>item_id</code>、<code>channel</code>、<code>field</code>、<code>error_code</code>、<code>rule_version</code>、<code>batch_id</code>。<code>rule_version</code> 是关键——同一 item 三个月前能过、现在失败，几乎总是映射规则集版本变了的锅，回滚规则集即可解释并修复一批失败。进度游标让 OOM 后的续跑不必从头开始：以固定 item 区间（每 5 万条）把「已完成区间号 + 该区间制品哈希」落盘，重启时从最后一个完整区间之后继续，区间内半成品直接丢弃重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分片上传-分块-续传与完整性校验\">分片上传：分块、续传与完整性校验</h2><p>传输期故障的解法是把「一次大上传」拆成可独立重试的「多次小上传」。Amazon S3 官方建议对象达到 100 MB 就考虑分片上传：单分片 5 MiB–5 GiB，一次上传最多 10,000 个分片，单对象最大 48.8 TiB（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/qfacts.html\">AWS S3 multipart upload 规格</a>）。三者共同约束分片大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> MiB</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>5</mn><mtext> GiB</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\in [5\\ \\text{MiB},\\ 5\\ \\text{GiB}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MiB</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GiB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 且分片数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = \\lceil S/c \\rceil \\le 10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为制品总字节数）。</p>\n<p>由此得两条硬规则：<strong>分片不能小于 5 MiB</strong>——只有最后一片允许更小，否则 S3 拒绝；<strong>分片不能小到让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 爆掉</strong>——10,000 个 5 MiB 分片只覆盖约 48.8 GB，若制品有 200 GB 就必须放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。实践中选固定分片（8–64 MiB）让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 稳定在几百量级。真正值钱的是<strong>续传</strong>：每片完成后记录 ETag，连接断开只需重传未完成分片而非从 0 开始；生成端必须维护跨进程可恢复的分片清单（part number → ETag → 状态），且清单必须绑定制品内容哈希——制品重新生成后哈希变了，旧清单即作废。</p>\n<p>上传通道常是渠道颁发的短时效预签名 URL。Amazon SP-API 的 Feeds 流程是典型样本：先调 <code>createFeedDocument</code> 拿到 <code>feedDocumentId</code> 和上传用 presigned URL，该 URL <strong>5 分钟后过期</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/amzn/selling-partner-api-models/blob/main/models/feeds-api-model/feeds_2021-06-30.json\">feeds_2021-06-30.json</a>）；上传完再调 <code>createFeed</code> 提交并轮询状态；下载侧同样给 5 分钟 URL，若制品被压缩则响应带 <code>compressionAlgorithm: GZIP</code> 提示客户端自己解压。5 分钟是很紧的窗口，意味着<strong>上传必须在拿到 URL 后立刻开始</strong>；若排队可能超过窗口，就提前分片，让每片各自换 URL。最后用制品哈希（对象存储支持 CRC32C / SHA-256 整对象校验）比对本地与远端：不做这步，一个静默截断的 gzip 包会在渠道侧表现为「解析成功但少了 4 万条商品」，比明确的解析失败难排得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等重试-为什么重试会制造重复\">幂等重试：为什么重试会制造重复</h2><p>写入期重试最危险，因为它违反直觉：一次「失败」的重试可能已经成功。网络超时只说明<strong>没有收到响应</strong>，不说明<strong>请求没有到达</strong>。分布式系统的标准语义是 at-least-once，重复投递是常态；要得到 exactly-once 效果，只能靠接收方去重，而那要求请求携带跨重试稳定的业务唯一键——即对任意请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(f(x)) = f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>实现它有三条现实路径，按可靠性排序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>稳定性来源</th>\n<th>失效场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>业务唯一键</td>\n<td>商品 <code>id</code> / <code>retailer_id</code> / GTIN</td>\n<td>由业务定义，跨批次不变</td>\n<td>键本身选错（用可变字段当键）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道批次句柄</td>\n<td><code>feedId</code> / batch <code>handle</code></td>\n<td>由渠道颁发，重试沿用同一句柄</td>\n<td>每次重试都新建句柄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端幂等令牌</td>\n<td>自生成的 <code>request_id</code></td>\n<td>客户端持久化，重试复用</td>\n<td>令牌在重试前丢了，重新生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一条最根本：<strong>用可变字段做唯一键是幂等性的天敌</strong>——用标题或价格当键，商品改了标题就会被当成新商品创建；正确键是 SKU / retailer_id 这类发布后不改的标识符。第三条最容易被忽略：<code>request_id</code> 若存在内存里，进程一重启就丢了，去重形同虚设——它必须与制品持久化在同一份状态里。</p>\n<p>退避策略决定重试是帮忙还是添乱。对 HTTP 429 与瞬时 5xx，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min(t_{\\max},\\ t_0 \\cdot 2^{n}) \\cdot U(0.5, 1.5)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基础间隔、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是重试次数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(0.5,1.5)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是抖动因子。抖动不是点缀：没有它，一批同时失败的任务会在同一时刻集体重试，把限流窗口再次打满，形成重试风暴。Meta 目录的批量写入给出另一类约束——单次请求最多 5,000 条记录、官方建议控制在 3,000 以内，请求体上限 28 MB，超限返回错误码 80014（来源：<a href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/docs/marketing-api/reference/product-catalog/items_batch/\">Meta catalog items_batch</a>）。命中的批次应<strong>先拆小再重试</strong>，而非原样重发。</p>\n<p>Google 侧的配额语义必须尊重：配额「按方法」计算，超限分别返回 <code>quota/request_rate_too_high</code> 与 <code>quota/daily_limit_exceeded</code>；<code>customBatch</code> 里<strong>每个方法调用都单独计入该方法自己的配额</strong>；商品资源更新官方建议平均不超过每天两次（来源：<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/guides/limits\">Content API quotas and limits</a>）。所以限流错误退避重试，配额耗尽则停止并告警——再重试到明天之前都不会成功。另有一条 2026 年时间线：Content API for Shopping 已于 <strong>2026 年 8 月 18 日停止服务</strong>，自 <strong>2026 年 9 月 1 日起请求出现渐进式错误</strong>，迁移目标是 Merchant API（来源：<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/guides/migration\">迁移与停用指引</a>）；仍在用 <code>customBatch</code> 的链路，重试策略要连同迁移一起改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机与补偿-上传成功不等于商品已生效\">状态机与补偿：上传成功不等于商品已生效</h2><p>写入期最容易踩的坑，是把「请求被接受」当成「变更已生效」。Amazon SP-API 的 feed 状态枚举显式化了这层区分，五个取值：<code>IN_QUEUE</code>（未开始，可能在等另一个 <code>IN_PROGRESS</code> 的 feed）、<code>IN_PROGRESS</code>（处理中）、<code>DONE</code>（已处理完成，但<strong>必须检查结果文档才能知道是否有错误</strong>）、<code>CANCELLED</code>（开始处理前被取消）、<code>FATAL</code>（因致命错误中止，且「部分、全部或没有任何操作可能已经成功」）（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/amzn/selling-partner-api-models/blob/main/models/feeds-api-model/feeds_2021-06-30.json\">SP-API feeds 模型</a>）。<code>FATAL</code> 的官方描述几乎就是本节的论点：<strong>一个失败的批次可能已经部分生效</strong>。</p>\n<p>因此失败后的动作不是「重发」，而是「先查明已生效的边界，再补齐差额」。Meta 用了同一套模式：提交 <code>items_batch</code> 后响应返回 <code>handles</code> 数组（长度 0 或 1，空数组意味着什么都没被接收），拿 handle 去 <code>check_batch_request_status</code> 轮询状态，<code>validation_status</code> 逐条给出 <code>retailer_id</code> 与错误（来源：同上）。这个「句柄 + 轮询 + 逐条校验」三段式是异步批量写入的通用契约。</p>\n<p>补偿流程因此是：超时的批次不要新建，带原句柄查状态；<code>DONE</code> 就拉结果文档逐条核对、失败项单独走小批次补发；<code>FATAL</code> 就用业务唯一键在渠道侧做存在性对账，只补真正缺失的 item。最后落成一条可执行纪律：<strong>每次写入都必须能回答三个问题——用哪个唯一键去重、用哪个句柄查询、用哪个字段判断已生效。</strong> 答不上来就不能接入自动重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三个失败面恢复语义不同：转换期与传输期可安全重跑，写入期重跑会制造重复——判断标准是「重跑会不会产生两个可观测结果」。</li>\n<li>转换期用逐 item 错误边界把批量失败降解为单条失败，用失败半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 决定继续发布还是整批中止，用 <code>rule_version</code> 解释「以前能过现在不能过」。</li>\n<li>传输期用分片把大上传拆成可独立重试的小单元；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> MiB</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> GiB</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\in [5\\ \\text{MiB}, 5\\ \\text{GiB}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MiB</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GiB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\le 10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span> 双重约束分片大小；续传清单必须绑定制品哈希；SP-API 的 5 分钟预签名 URL 要求「取 URL—上传—提交」不可分割。</li>\n<li>幂等性靠跨重试稳定的业务唯一键而非「小心地重试」，<code>request_id</code> 必须持久化；退避要加抖动并区分限流错误与配额耗尽；批次超限（Meta 的 28 MB / 5,000 条）应先拆小再重试。</li>\n<li>上传成功不等于生效：<code>DONE</code> 要查结果文档，<code>FATAL</code> 可能已部分生效，失败后的正确动作是对账补偿。<a href=\"feed-schema-field-mapping\">Feed Schema 建模与字段映射规则</a> 定义了什么是「一条合法的 item」，本文定义的是这条 item 抵达渠道前可能死在哪一步。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"转换异常、分片上传与幂等重试","id":"转换异常-分片上传与幂等重试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一条 feed 流水线的三个失败面","id":"核心概念-一条-feed-流水线的三个失败面"},{"level":2,"text":"转换期异常：把批量失败降解为逐 item 失败","id":"转换期异常-把批量失败降解为逐-item-失败"},{"level":2,"text":"分片上传：分块、续传与完整性校验","id":"分片上传-分块-续传与完整性校验"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等重试：为什么重试会制造重复","id":"幂等重试-为什么重试会制造重复"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机与补偿：上传成功不等于商品已生效","id":"状态机与补偿-上传成功不等于商品已生效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Feed 生成流水线、增量渲染与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/feed-build-transform/feed-generation-pipeline-scheduling"},"next":{"title":"跨境商品内容合规规则建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/compliance-validation-quality/regulatory-content-compliance-rules"}}